# P93 on Windows: two window groups and a single window; nothing to press. Run with SCUI_P93_MENU=1 SCUI_DEBUG_MENU_DUMP=1 to read the bar back -- without SCUI_P93_MENU there is no bar on Windows and the dump is empty: File > New > New Alpha Window / New Beta Window, Solo in the Window menu (reference/swiftui-commands/two-groups.txt). Both backends matched it 2026-10-20.
# P93(Windows):不需按任何東西；以 SCUI_P93_MENU=1 SCUI_DEBUG_MENU_DUMP=1 讀回選單列並與 two-groups.txt 比對——少了 SCUI_P93_MENU,Windows 上沒有選單列、傾印是空的。2026-10-20 兩個 backend 皆相符。
